<span class="h3"><a href="#section-7.2" id="section-7.2" data-is-hyperlink data-non-rfc-anchor-link class="selflink"><!--[--><!--[-->7.2<!--]--><!--]--></a>.  Informative References</span>

   [<a id="ref-RFC0822" data-is-nuxt-link data-non-rfc-anchor-link><!--[--><!--[-->RFC0822<!--]--><!--]--></a>]         Crocker, D., &quot;Standard for the format of ARPA
