                     August 1982.

   [<a id="ref-RFC1305" data-is-nuxt-link data-non-rfc-anchor-link><!--[--><!--[-->RFC1305<!--]--><!--]--></a>]         Mills, D., &quot;Network Time Protocol (Version 3)
